    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "U Baroorashadii Masar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, wax sii sheeg, oo waxaad tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Hoogga maalinta u baroorta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, maalintii waa soo dhow dahay, maalintii Rabbigu waa soo dhow dahay, waana maalin daruuro madow leh, oo waxay noqon doontaa wakhtigii quruumaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo seef baa Masar ku dul dhici doonta, oo Itoobiyana waxaa jiri doona xanuun weyn, markii kuwa la laayay ay Masar ku dhex dhacaan, oo markaasaa maalkeeda badan la qaadan doonaa oo aasaaskeedana waa la dumin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa iyaga seef kula dhiman doona Itoobiya, iyo Fuud, iyo Luud, iyo dadka isku qasan oo dhan, iyo Kuub, iyo dadka dalka iyaga axdiga la dhigtay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Kuwa dalka Masar tiiriyaa way dhici doonaan, oo kibirka xooggiisuna hoos buu u soo dhici doonaa, oo tan iyo Migdol, iyo ilaa Seweeneeh ayay seef ugu le'an doonaan, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo cidla bay ku ahaan doonaan waddammada cidlada ah dhexdooda, oo magaalooyinkeeduna waxay ku dhex jiri doonaan magaalooyinka baabba'ay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaan Masar dab ku dhejiyo oo ay caawimayaasheeda oo dhammu wada baabba'aan waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas waxaa iga ambabbixi doona wargeeysyo doonniyo fuushan inay cabsiiyaan kuwa reer Itoobiya oo aan waxba tuhunsanayn, oo waxaa iyaga ku soo kor degi doona xanuun weyn sidii wakhtigii Masar oo kale, waayo, bal eeg, waxyaalahaasu way imanayaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaan ka dhigi doonaa in dadka badan ee Masar ay gacanta Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon ku dhammaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga iyo dadkiisa la jira oo ah kuwa ugu nac weyn ee quruumaha ayaa loo keeni doonaa inay dalka baabbi'iyaan, oo seefahooda ayay Masar ula bixi doonaan oo waxay dalka ka buuxin doonaan kuwa la laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo webiyaashana waan wada engejin doonaa, oo dalkana gacanta sharrowyada waan ka iibin doonaa, oo dalka iyo kuwa dhex degganba waxaan ku wada baabbi'in doonaa gacanta shisheeyayaasha. Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa saas ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Weliba sanamyada waan wada burburin doonaa, oo ekaamahana Nof baan ka baabbi'in doonaa, oo mar dambena ma uu jiri doono amiir dalka Masar u taliyaa, oo dalka Masarna cabsi baan ku soo dejin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Fatroos ayaan cidla ka dhigi doonaa, Socanna dab baan qabadsiin doonaa, oo Noona xukummo baan ku soo dejin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan cadhadayda ku dul shubi doonaa Siin oo ah qalcadda Masar, oo dadka badan oo Noona waan baabbi'in doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masarna dab baan ka dhex shidi doonaa. Siin xanuun weyn bay heli doontaa, Noona waa la wada burburin doonaa, oo Nofna maalinta oo dhan waa la cidhiidhin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barbaarrada Aawen iyo Fiibesed seef bay ku le'an doonaan, oo magaalooyinkaasna maxaabiis ahaan baa loo kaxaysan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Texafneheesna maalintaa ku madoobaan doonta, markaan harqoodyada Masar halkaas ku jejebin doono, kibirka xooggeeduna wuu ka dhex baabbi'i doonaa, oo iyada daruur baa qarin doonta, oo gabdhaheedana maxaabiis ahaan baa loo kaxaysan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasaan Masar xukummo ugu soo dejin doonaa, oo waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii kow iyo tobnaad, bisheedii kowaad, maalinteedii toddobaad ayaa eraygii Rabbigu ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, Fircoon oo ah boqorka Masar gacantiisaan jebiyey, oo bal eeg, lama kabin si ay u bogsato, oo waxba laguma duubin in xoog loo yeelo si ay seef u qaaddo aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eeg, anigu col baan ku ahay Fircoon oo ah boqorka Masar, oo gacmihiisana waan jejebin doonaa, tan xoogga leh iyo tii jabtayba, oo weliba waxaan ka dhigi doonaa in seeftu gacantiisa ka dhacdo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masriyiintana waxaan ku kala eryi doonaa quruumaha dhexdooda, waddammadana waan ku kala dhex firdhin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xoog baan u yeeli doonaa gacmaha boqorka Baabuloon, oo seeftaydana gacantiisaan u dhiibi doonaa, laakiinse Fircoon gacmihiisaan jejebin doonaa, oo hortiisuu kaga cabaadi doonaa sida nin dhaawac ahu uu u cabaado oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse gacmaha boqorka Baabuloon kor baan u qaadi doonaa, oo gacmaha Fircoonna hoos bay u dhici doonaan, oo markaan seeftayda gacanta boqorka Baabuloon u dhiibo, oo uu dalka Masar ku dul fidiyo, waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masriyiinta waxaan ku kala eryi doonaa quruumaha dhexdooda, waddammadana waan ku kala dhex firdhin doonaa, oo waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
